The ModelForge C++ inference engine (app/src/main/cpp) is original work and is
covered by the Apache License 2.0 above. It implements its own transformer
training and inference code and does not include or link third-party model
weights. Models trained with it use fixed sinusoidal positional encoding and
LayerNorm, and are therefore not numerically identical to RoPE/RMSNorm models.
